-- The coefficient engine of the bundled polynomial ring: membership in
-- polynomialRing(R, I) is membership in the polynomial carrier, equality
-- is coefficientwise, the sum, negative, zero, and product have their
-- coefficient formulas, and the coefficients of a variable, a constant,
-- and a product by either are read off; everything here is ZF
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
